[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-TEMPLATE-EC-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Template edge-case requirement
TYPE: REQUIREMENT
CATEGORY: EdgeCase
PRIORITY: High
SAFETY_CLASS: NotSafetyRelated
STATEMENT: When the defined boundary condition occurs, the system shall produce the specified bounded behavior.
RATIONALE: The boundary condition requires behavior that can be verified independently from the nominal path.
ACCEPTANCE: Given the boundary condition, when the triggering action occurs, then the specified result is produced without an unintended state transition.
