[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-TEMPLATE-ERR-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Template error-handling requirement
TYPE: REQUIREMENT
CATEGORY: Error
PRIORITY: High
SAFETY_CLASS: NotSafetyRelated
STATEMENT: If the defined error condition occurs, the system shall enter the specified error state and provide the defined externally observable response.
RATIONALE: The error requires deterministic handling and independent verification.
ACCEPTANCE: >>>
Given:
- the defined error can be injected or reproduced.
When:
- the error occurs during the applicable operation.
Then:
- the specified response is produced
- the resulting system state is observable
- no prohibited side effect occurs.
